#!/bin/bash
# Find and run a binary from the cwb build tree. Resolves relative to this
# script (works from any cwd). Searches the single-config cwb build, the fetched
# ces build (ces / cesh), and per-config subdirs.
BUILD="$(dirname "$(readlink -f "$0")")/build"
SEARCH=(
  "$BUILD"
  "$BUILD/_deps/ces-build"
  "$BUILD/debug" "$BUILD/release" "$BUILD/relwithdebinfo" "$BUILD/minsizerel"
)
if [ -z "$1" ]; then
  echo "run: finds and runs a binary under $BUILD (and _deps/ces-build)" >&2
  echo "Usage: $0 <binary> [args...]" >&2
  exit 1
fi
BIN="$1"; shift
for d in "${SEARCH[@]}"; do
  if [ -x "$d/$BIN" ]; then exec "$d/$BIN" "$@"; fi
done
echo "ERROR: run: could not find '$BIN' under $BUILD" >&2
exit 1
